# Project Licensing

This repository contains two categories of materials under dual open licenses, alongside third-party short quotations and public evidence archives governed by fair use / academic citation principles:

1. **Software & Source Code (`toolkit/`, `media/generator/`, `.github/`)**: Licensed under the **MIT License** (see Part I below).
2. **Original Research Reports, Documentation & Curated Analytical Datasets (`README.md`, `docs/`, `datasets/`, `my-forecasts/`, `media/previews/`, `media/subtitles/`)**: Licensed under the **Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0)** (see Part II below).
3. **Third-Party Short Quotations & Archived Public Evidence (`cases/*/data/`)**: See Part III below.

