## Part III — Third-Party Quotations & Public Evidence Notice

- Full-text books are **strictly excluded** from this repository.
- Short excerpts (`quote`) in `cases/*/data/claims.jsonl` and public statistical/institutional records in `cases/*/data/sources/` are retained solely for scholarly verification, reproducibility, and empirical criticism/commentary.
- Copyrights in quoted third-party books, articles, and archived public web sources remain with their respective original authors and publishers; this repository grants no separate redistribution license over third-party works.
